upahanyām imāḥ prajāḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1130,\"bb\":1006,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/24/b1006/\",\"shadow_value\":\"utsīdeyuḥ – would be put into ruin; ime – all these; lokāḥ – worlds; na – not; kuryām – I perform; karma – prescribed duties; cet – if; aham – I; saṅkarasya – of unwanted population; ca – and; kartā – creator; syām – would be; upahanyām – would destroy; imāḥ – all these; prajāḥ – living entities.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"utsīdeyuḥ\",\"translation\":\"would be put into ruin\"},{\"word\":\"ime\",\"translation\":\"all these\"},{\"word\":\"lokāḥ\",\"translation\":\"worlds\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"not\"},{\"word\":\"kuryām\",\"translation\":\"I perform\"},{\"word\":\"karma\",\"translation\":\"prescribed duties\"},{\"word\":\"cet\",\"translation\":\"if\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I\"},{\"word\":\"saṅkarasya\",\"translation\":\"of unwanted population\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"kartā\",\"translation\":\"creator\"},{\"word\":\"syām\",\"translation\":\"would be\"},{\"word\":\"upahanyām\",\"translation\":\"would destroy\"},{\"word\":\"imāḥ\",\"translation\":\"all these\"},{\"word\":\"prajāḥ\",\"translation\":\"living entities\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1131,\"bb\":1007,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/24/b1007/\",\"body_value\":\"If I did not perform prescribed duties, all these worlds would be put to ruination. I would be the cause of creating unwanted population, and I would thereby destroy the peace of all living beings.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1132,\"bb\":1008,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/24/b1008/\",\"body_val