कुर्याद्विद्वांस्तथासक्तश्चिकीर्षुर्लोकसङ्‍‍ग्रहम् ॥ २५ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1139,\"bb\":1014,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/25/b1014/\",\"body_value\":\"saktāḥ karmaṇy avidvāṁso
yathā kurvanti bhārata
kuryād vidvāṁs tathāsaktaś
cikīrṣur loka-saṅgraham\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1140,\"bb\":1015,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/25/b1015/\",\"shadow_value\":\"saktāḥ – being attached; karmaṇi – in prescribed duties; avidvāṁsaḥ – the ignorant; yathā – as much as; kurvanti – they do; bhārata – O descendant of Bharata; kuryāt – must do; vidvān – the learned; tathā – thus; asaktaḥ – without attachment; cikīrṣuḥ – desiring to lead; loka-saṅgraham – the people in general.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"saktāḥ\",\"translation\":\"being attached\"},{\"word\":\"karmaṇi\",\"translation\":\"in prescribed duties\"},{\"word\":\"avidvāṁsaḥ\",\"translation\":\"the ignorant\"},{\"word\":\"yathā\",\"translation\":\"as much as\"},{\"word\":\"kurvanti\",\"translation\":\"they do\"},{\"word\":\"bhārata\",\"translation\":\"O descendant of Bharata\"},{\"word\":\"kuryāt\",\"translation\":\"must do\"},{\"word\":\"vidvān\",\"translation\":\"the learned\"},{\"word\":\"tathā\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"asaktaḥ\",\"translation\":\"without attachment\"},{\"word\":\"cikīrṣuḥ\",\"translation\":\"desiring to lead\"},{\"word\":\"loka-saṅgraham\",\"translation\":\"the people in general\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1141,\"bb\":1016,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/25/b1016/\",\"body_value\":\"As the ignorant perform their duties with attachment to results, the learned may similarly act, but without attachment, for the sake of leading people on the right path.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1142,\"bb\":1017,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/3/25/b1017/\",\"body_value\":\"A person in Kṛṣṇa consciousness and a person not in Kṛṣṇa consciousness are differentiated by different desires. A Kṛṣṇa conscious person does not do anything which is not conducive to development of Kṛṣṇa consciousness. He may even act exactly like the ignorant person, who is too much attached to material activities, but one is engaged in such activities for the satisfaction of his sense gratification, whereas the other is engaged for the satisfaction of Kṛṣṇa. Therefore, the Kṛṣṇa conscious person is required to show the people how to act and how to engage the results of action for the purpose of Kṛṣṇa consciousness.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 3.25\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 3.25\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"children\":\"Library\"}],\" » \"]}],[\"$\",